# ANTIPODE: the gates. A nano-wall opens when every sentry orb of its room
# is gone. A shutter opens when its target, inside the wall, is shot: only
# PHASER shots get through to it. In the quiet vault (the Brine, under a
# cracked floor) a grey wall slides away when the pad in the floor and the
# pad in the ceiling over it are pressed at once: the suit on one, its
# shadow (AFTERIMAGE) left on the other in the other gravity.
seed 1
game antipode
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat room 2 p
expect foes_10 == 3
expect door_2vp == 103
expect gate_103 == 0
expect tileat_8_250 == 10
cheat killfoe 0
cheat killfoe 1
expect gate_103 == 0
cheat killfoe 2
expect gate_103 == 1
expect tileat_8_250 == 8
cheat nofoes
# the shutter between the Gantry's rooms N and f: its target sits in the
# wall over it, level with the suit's gun when it walks the ceiling
cheat room 0 f
expect door_0Nf == 7
cheat pos 72 74
cheat grav -1
wait 5
expect ground == 1
hold LEFT 2
hold A 30
release ALL
expect tileat_8_90 == 10
expect gate_7 == 0
cheat mod 2 3
hold A 30
release ALL
expect gate_7 == 1
expect tileat_8_90 == 0
cheat mod 2 -1
# the quiet vault's pads
cheat mod 1 1
cheat room 1 r
expect secret == 0
expect tileat_104_88 == 14
cheat pos 232 134
cheat grav 1
wait 10
expect ground == 1
# on the floor pad, jump and flip at once: the shadow stays on the floor pad
# and the suit falls up onto the ceiling pad
press B
press B
expect shadow == 1
expect grav == -1
waituntil ground == 1 60
expect py == 26
wait 2
expect secret == 1
expect tileat_104_88 == 0
# it stays open (it is saved with the run)
cheat room 1 r
expect tileat_104_88 == 0
